# Browser-suite evidence. tests/ui/full-role-submission-e2e.mjs writes a
# timestamped run directory of full-page PNGs into this tracked path, so a
# routine test run dirtied the tree by ~5 MB; ten runs (~35 MB, five of them
# re-runs minutes apart) were committed before this rule existed. Keep the
# harness writing here, keep the output out of git.
docs/testing/artifacts/ui-e2e/
